PositionFactory::setBeacon(PositionType,address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _beacon is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryZeroAddress
    ├── when beacon is already set for positionType
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryBeaconAlreadySet
    └── when beacon is not set for positionType
        ├── it should set beacon[positionType]
        └── it should emit BeaconSet
